Do not declare the redesign complete until:

* The host page has one obvious focal point.
* The camera or digital twin occupies most of the workspace.
* No decorative gradients remain.
* No glowing dots remain.
* No neon borders remain.
* No arbitrary icon pills remain.
* No generic dashboard card grid remains.
* Typography is consistent.
* Worker states remain understandable.
* The task graph remains functional.
* WebSocket updates continue functioning.
* Five worker clients can connect.
* Object overlays follow tracked positions.
* Calibration works after resizing.
